{% set intro_content %}
<h2>The whole corridor</h2>
<p>If you're somewhere between Lions Bay and Pemberton, you're in our delivery range without a freight bill. We're based in Squamish, which puts us in the middle of the corridor.</p>
<p>The Sea-to-Sky is also where our mobile saunas make the most sense. Trailer-mounted units you can tow to the lake, the trailhead, a rental property, or an event site. We build them for hospitality operators, rental businesses, and people who want a sauna that goes where they go.</p>
<p>Britannia Beach, Furry Creek, Brackendale, Whistler, Pemberton. Same team, same builds, same pricing.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set local_content %}
<h2>Corridor builds</h2>
<p>Brackendale Art Gallery (Squamish), residential S4 and S6 builds in Brackendale, a residential S4 in Pemberton. Our mobile units have been at events from Squamish to Whistler. Finnish Sauna Co runs one of our builds on Vancouver Island.</p>
<p>If you're anywhere in the corridor and thinking about a sauna, <a href="/contact/" class="link--accent-underline">start here</a>.</p>
